---@field displayName? string The file name shown to the user, e.g. "hotel_booking_tdd.md". Set on STARTED (and repeated on FINALIZED).
---@field state? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.ArtifactChunkStateEnum Lifecycle position of this chunk.
---@field mimeType? string The IANA media type of the artifact content, e.g. "text/markdown".
---@field artifactId? string Identifier of the artifact, stable across all chunks of one artifact within the stream.
---@field gcsUri? string The Cloud Storage object the artifact was persisted to. Set on FINALIZED chunks.
---@field contentDelta? string Incremental artifact content. Set on DELTA chunks.
---@field targetApp? string Output only. The app this artifact was produced for, when it was produced for one. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/apps/{app}`

---@alias gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.ArtifactChunkStateEnum "STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"STARTED"|"DELTA"|"FINALIZED"|"FAILED"|"CLOSED"

