---@field runCount? number Output only. The number of times the evaluations inside the run were run.
---@field operation? string Output only. The operation that created this evaluation run. Format: `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/operations/{operation}`
---@field evaluationRunSummaries? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.EvaluationRunEvaluationRunSummaryMap Output only. Map of evaluation name to EvaluationRunSummary.
