---@field personaRunConfigs? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.PersonaRunConfigList Output only. The configuration to use for the run per persona.
---@field goldenRunMethod? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.EvaluationRunGoldenRunMethodEnum Output only. The method used to run the evaluation.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.Status Output only. Deprecated: Use error_info instead. Errors encountered during execution.

