---@field authorizationUrl? string Required. The authorization URL to be used for this flow.
---@field refreshUrl? string The URL to be used for obtaining refresh tokens.
---@field tokenUrl? string Required. The token URL to be used for this flow.
---@field scopes? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.StringMap Required. The available scopes for the OAuth2 security scheme.

