---@field id? string Required. Unique identifier (e.g. UUID) for the task, generated by the server for a new task.
---@field contextId? string Unique identifier (e.g. UUID) for the contextual collection of interactions (tasks and messages).
---@field status? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.LfA2aV1TaskStatus Required. The current status of a `Task`, including `state` and a `message`.

