---@class gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.StreamChatAiAssistantResponse
---@field eventTime? string Timestamp when the event occurred.
---@field toolResponse? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.ToolResponse Tool call response event.
---@field sequenceNumber? string Optional. Monotonically increasing sequence number for this session turn.
---@field resumeSnapshot? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.TurnResumeSnapshot A compacted replay of an in-flight turn, sent as the first event of every attach or resume before any live event. The client replaces any locally rendered state for this turn with the snapshot's contents.
---@field uiEvent? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.UiEvent Optional. UI event payload.
---@field confirmationRequest? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.AssistantConfirmationRequest A blocking confirmation the agent paused on. The agent resumes when the answer arrives on a later request's `confirmation_response`. Only sent to clients that declared the CONFIRMATION_CARDS capability on the request.
---@field handoff? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.TurnHandoffEvent Tells the client to silently reconnect with resume_from_sequence_number: the task serving this stream is going away and the turn will continue elsewhere. Not an error; the stream completes normally after this event.
---@field thoughtChunk? string Thought text chunk (agent's reasoning before generating response).
---@field textChunk? string Text Token (for streaming Gemini responses word-by-word).
---@field toolCall? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.ToolCall Tool call execution event.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.Status Simple status update.
---@field turnMetadata? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.TurnMetadata Optional. Turn-level metadata and intent categorization.
---@field eventId? string Unique identifier for the event.
---@field artifactChunk? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.ArtifactChunk Generated-document artifact event (live preview deltas + final Cloud Storage pointer).
---@field turnCompleted? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.TurnCompletedEvent The turn has ended. Sent as the last event of every turn, on the original stream and on every attached or resumed stream, so clients can end the turn on an explicit signal instead of inferring it from stream closure.
---@field turnInProgress? boolean Optional. Indicates whether the turn is still actively running in the background.
---@field optionQuestionsChunk? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.OptionQuestionsChunk Structured clarification options parsed out of the model turn. The console renders these as a selectable option list instead of raw text.
---@field sessionCheckpoint? gcp.unstable.ces_v1beta.SessionCheckpoint Session checkpoint/compaction recap event containing user intent and rolling summary.

